# The trial of pod-egress part 2 in podssh (T-035; calls C621 to C625), at
# podssh's main 2ffb7cd7 (pod-egress-part2.commit), after the trial of part
# 1 (pod-egress-part2.needs). podssh-ws's vless/, vmess/, trojan/ and
# shadowsocks/ become modules of glue over pod-egress (pub use
# pod_egress::ROAD::*, and podssh's way out for a ProxyChoice: vless::dial,
# shadowsocks::dial); podssh-cli and proxy_nodes build each Dial with
# podssh_ws::client::way. The tests vless, vmess, trojan, shadowsocks and
# shadowsocks_2022, vmess-interop.yml and the plant t440 leave podssh;
# tests/vless_support/ and trojan_support/ stay for proxy_nodes, hysteria
# and tuic. Each podcrates tag moves to v0.52.0. The steps: the record with
# its citations, the repository checks; no moved file stays; pod-egress
# with the four features in the tree; clippy and the tests of podssh-ws with
# each feature; clippy of the CLI; the CLI's unit tests of the roads and its
# tests of the roads and of the public proxy nodes; rustfmt of the changed
# crates; each Rust toolchain of the workflows against the rust-version of
# podcrates; each test target that the gate names.
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- remap Cargo.lock > /dev/null
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- check
python3 scripts/check-repo.py
test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/src/vless && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/src/vmess && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/src/trojan && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/src/shadowsocks
test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/tests/vless.rs && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/tests/vmess.rs && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/tests/trojan.rs && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/tests/shadowsocks.rs && test ! -e crates/podssh-ws/tests/shadowsocks_2022.rs && test ! -e .github/workflows/vmess-interop.yml && test ! -e scripts/plants/t440-vless-refusal-unsaid.plant
cargo tree -q -p podssh-ws -e features -i pod-egress | grep -q 'pod-egress feature "shadowsocks"'
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-ws --all-features -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-ws --all-features
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-cli -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --lib -- vless trojan shadowsocks vmess forwarder::nodes doctor
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --test one_road --test shadowsocks_cli --test proxy_lists
cargo fmt -p podssh-ws -p podssh-cli --check
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-toolchains.py"
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-tests.py"
